---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Answer a question the assistant asked. For one question, use --choose and/or --other; for several, --answers-json

Usage: mxr assistant answer [OPTIONS] <CONVERSATION> <CALL_ID>

Arguments:
  <CONVERSATION>
  <CALL_ID>

Options:
      --choose <CHOOSE>              An option's label (repeatable for multi-select questions)
      --other <OTHER>                Your own answer
      --answers-json <ANSWERS_JSON>  One answer per question: [{"selected": ["Work"], "other": null}, ...]
      --no-wait
      --format <FORMAT>              [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                         Print help
